        rdfs:comment                   "White hankerchief. Border has the word \"VICTORY\" on each of the four sides printed in capital letters on top of a floral/garden-like background. In the center of the scarf there is a large white square section. Each corner has flags and the middle has shields with crests/symbols from different countries."@en ;
